% Literature cited by wahlwerk: books, papers, judgments, reports.
%
% Exported from Zotero (Better BibLaTeX, "Keep updated"); edit entries in Zotero, never
% here. Keys follow the Zotero library, {first author}.{ThreeWordTitle}.{year}; an entry
% the code or the site cites has its key pinned in Zotero (Extra: "Citation Key: ...") so
% a re-export never renames it. A docstring cites an entry with :cite:`key`.
%
% Statutes are NOT here. A law changes by amendment and is cited by version and section,
% so its record is the engine's own: every Law in wahlwerk.law (id per version,
% citation of the Fassung, source, in force from and until). Data sources are not here
% either: every bundle records its own [source]. See .github-private
% notes/decisions/0003-references.md.
